{"id":"efa147d556444fc2","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-veblen-base-function.md","title":"零阶 Veblen 函数","display":"df-veblen-base-function — 零阶 Veblen 函数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-veblen-base-function","aliases":["18-df-veblen-base-function","18-df-025"],"display":"df-veblen-base-function — 零阶 Veblen 函数","depends_on":["[[18-df-veblen-hierarchy]]"],"source_edition":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity","source_section":"Lemma 3.4.8(1)","source_pages":"37","source_pdf_pages":"47","verification_status":"source-statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-veblen-base-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-veblen-base-function</span><span>18-df-025</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-veblen-base-function — 零阶 Veblen 函数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"40176d5c80238174\" href=\"?note=40176d5c80238174\" title=\"18-df-veblen-hierarchy\">18-df-veblen-hierarchy</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Pohlers 2009, Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Lemma 3.4.8(1)"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"37"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"47"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"40176d5c80238174\" href=\"?note=40176d5c80238174\" title=\"18-df-veblen-hierarchy\">18-df-veblen-hierarchy</a> 已定义的 Veblen 族，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^\\beta\">\\(\\omega^\\beta\\)</span> 为其零层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\varphi_0(\\beta)=\\omega^\\beta.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\varphi_0(\\beta)=\\omega^\\beta.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是已定义函数的特征等式，不是再次独立引入 φ₀；对应 Lemma 3.4.8(1)。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-veblen-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"40176d5c80238174","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-veblen-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-veblen-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"40176d5c80238174","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}$；$\\varphi$ 为 [[18-df-veblen-hierarchy]] 已定义的 Veblen 族，$\\omega^\\beta$ 为其零层。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega^\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\varphi_0(\\beta)=\\omega^\\beta.","display":true}],"bytes":869,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-55","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-veblen-base-function]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-111","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-veblen-base-function]]"},{"id":"bf01645e59119446","anchor":"ref-109","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-df-veblen-base-function|18-df-veblen-base-function]]"},{"id":"09f8f6fb03023072","anchor":"ref-61","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":